  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
  "description": "This stereotype equates Black people with apes or monkeys, dehumanizing them and reinforcing racist ideologies. It is a well-documented form of anti-Black racism that has historical roots in slavery and colonialism. The meme uses the image of an orangutan (a primate) to visually reinforce this harmful stereotype, implying that Black people are 'ape-like' or inferior.",
